    {
      "id": "claim_a234f0ca61ea4c63a63c03e08ccb4130",
      "statement": "The runtime service hostnames ZM_DB_HOST and MQTT_HOST are hard-coded in docker-compose.yml to the Compose service names 'db' and 'eclipse-mosquitto' respectively (with ZM_SERVER_HOST=zoneminder); they are not sourced from the .env file.",
