      "id": "claim_829a203c66d94f6095f0300336d5cca5",
      "statement": "Dependabot is configured only for the 'docker' package ecosystem at directory '/', on a weekly schedule; Python (pip3), Perl (CPAN), and cloned-repository dependencies inside the image builds are not covered by automated dependency updates.",
