    {
      "id": "claim_e47b4b0a61684f799844b50c1c7d73fb",
      "statement": "The Mosquitto entrypoint generates a mosquitto.conf containing only 'listener 1883' (plus persistence); it never defines a WebSocket listener, so host port 9001 published by docker-compose.override.yml has no listener inside the container by default.",
