    {
      "id": "claim_9938e8fcdf574a75ad1f419f18ff5273",
      "statement": "entrypoint.sh contains 'exec \"$@\"' between the database initialization and the config rewrites/service starts; because the image defines only an ENTRYPOINT with no CMD, the exec is a no-op during normal operation, but if the container is started with a command override, exec replaces the shell and none of the config rewrites, secrets generation, or apache2/zoneminder service starts execute.",
      "evidence": [
